.SH "NOTES"
The unmap option (-u) is most likely useful only for development purposes.
.PP
\fBsn_dmap\fR execs the cvlabel command (/usr/cvfs/bin/cvlabel) to match
the StorNext volume name to the device.
.PP
\fBsn_dmap\fR is currently supported only on Linux.

